<TTL>Measurement</TTL><BRK/>
<TXT>Drilling Holes in Rock will be measured for payment to the nearest <MET>300 mm</MET> <ENG>foot</ENG> , based upon the <MET>meters</MET> <ENG>linear feet</ENG> of hole actually drilled in rock in accordance with the specifications.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/>
</SPT>
<SPT>
<TTL>Unit of Measure</TTL><BRK/>
