<TTL>Steel Bar</TTL><BRK/>
<TXT>[ <RID>ASTM A615/A615M</RID> ] [ <RID>ASTM A108</RID> , Grade [___]].</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/>
</SPT>
<SPT>
<TTL>Strand</TTL><BRK/>
<TXT><RID>ASTM A416/A416M</RID> , Grade <MET>[1725] [1860]</MET> <ENG>[250] [270]</ENG> , low relaxation strand. Do not weld strand.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/>
</SPT>
<SPT>
<TTL>Compact Strand</TTL><BRK/>
<TXT><RID>ASTM A779/A779M</RID> , Type <MET>[1790] [1860]</MET> <ENG>[260] [270]</ENG> , low relaxation strand. Strand must not be welded.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/>
</SPT>
<SPT>
<TTL>Epoxy Coated Strand</TTL><BRK/>
