<TXT>[ <RID>ASTM A500/A500M</RID> ] or [ <RID>API Spec 5CT</RID> , Grade N-80, Oil Field Seconds / Mill Secondary Tubing].</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/>
</SPT>
