<TTL>Ductile Iron Castings</TTL><BRK/>
<TXT><RID>ASTM A536</RID> .</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/>
</SPT>
<SPT>
<TTL>Polyethylene Tubing</TTL><BRK/>
<SPT>
<TTL>Smooth Polyethylene Tubing</TTL><BRK/>
<TXT>[ <RID>ASTM D3350</RID> ] [ <RID>ASTM D1248</RID> , Type III].</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/>
</SPT>
<SPT>
<TTL>Corrugated Polyethylene Tubing</TTL><BRK/>
<TXT><RID>PTI DC35.1</RID> -14 Section 4.7, with average minimum wall thickness of <MET>1.5 mm</MET> <ENG>0.06 inch</ENG> .</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/>
</SPT>
</SPT>
<SPT>
<TTL>Smooth Polypropylene Tubing</TTL><BRK/>
<TXT><RID>ASTM D4101</RID> , designation PP 210 B5542-11.</TXT><BRK/>
